body:
I can reproduce this with the `ignore` crate directly and
```rust
use ignore::Walk;
fn main() {
    for result in Walk::new("./some_dir") {
        match result {
            Ok(entry) => println!("{}", entry.path().display()),
            Err(err) => println!("ERROR: {}", err),
        }
    }
}
```
(with the CWD in the directory with the `.gitignore`)
